#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKta513_04046:TEXT_LUCKTA513_04046_SYSTEM_000_031:1"
msgid "The message can be viewed in your <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Portable Archive</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, which is available under Collection in the Duty section of the main menu."
msgstr ""

